Voicing our support and commitment to the system of socialism comes naturally, which pleases Bulgarian diplomats.

@1966_05_01_bd_vratsa
subtitle: Perhaps we could offer some assistance?
max-visits: 1
go-to: 1966_05_01_bd_vratsa_decision
on-arrival: relation_bulgaria += 0.01;

We make mention of the recent dam collapse near the Bulgarian town of Vratsa, which (according to recent reports) caused over 90 deaths and extensive damages. Bulgarians delegates are caught by surprise, as they didn't expect us to be aware of this incident.

@1966_05_01_bd_vratsa_decision
max-visits: 1

- @1966_05_01_bd_vratsa_personel: Offer to send emergency personnel to help with the disaster's management.
- @1966_05_01_bd_vratsa_aid: Offer material aid to assist with reconstruction efforts.
- @1966_05_01_bd_vratsa_nothing: Express condolences about the tragic event.

@1966_05_01_bd_vratsa_personel
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: emergency_personel += 1; relation_bulgaria += 0.1;

We offer to send medical and firefighter personnel to help deal with the disaster's aftermath. Bulgarian delegates gratefully accept, and as they take their leave, Ganovski reaffirms Bulgaria's commitment to our fraternal relationship and cooperation.

This might stretch our domestic emergency personnel a bit, though.

@1966_05_01_bd_vratsa_aid
max-visits: 1
# WIP - ECONOMIC EFFECTS
on-arrival: relation_bulgaria += 0.1; economic_growth += 0.1; budget -= 1;

We offer to send material aid to Bulgarian authorities and assist with reconstruction efforts. Bulgarian delegates gratefully accept, and as they take their leave, Ganovski reaffirms Bulgaria's commitment to our fraternal relationship and cooperation.

Since Czechoslovak companies are going to be involved in reconstruction, this might slightly boost our economy.

@1966_05_01_bd_vratsa_nothing
max-visits: 1

Bulgarian delegates appreciate our concern, although they seem a bit disappointed that we don't offer any real assistance. As they take their leave, Ganovski reaffirms Bulgaria's commitment to our fraternal relationship.

@1966_05_01_bd_end
subtitle: It's about time we wrap up...
max-visits: 1

The meeting ends on a positive note. As the Bulgarian delegation takes its leave, Ganovski reaffirms Bulgaria's commitment to our fraternal relationship.